          "_name": "list05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list05\" group=\"List\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Question\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#232323\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>PRACTICE AREAS</b></h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">At Lex &amp; Partners, our expertise spans across multiple legal disciplines:</h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n            <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>1. Corporate &amp; Commercial Law</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">We assist companies in drafting, reviewing, and negotiating commercial agreements, mergers, acquisitions, and compliance issues.\n<br>\n<br>Our goal is to protect your business interests while ensuring long-term growth.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>2. Civil &amp; Criminal Litigation</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">Our litigation team represents clients in civil disputes, contract breaches, personal injury claims, and criminal defense.\n<br>\n<br>We focus on strong case strategy, thorough research, and persuasive argumentation.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>3. Real Estate &amp; Property Law</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                            From property transactions to tenancy disputes, our firm provides reliable legal support to buyers, sellers, and developers.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>4. Family &amp; Divorce Law</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                            We handle sensitive family matters with care, confidentiality, and respect — including divorce, child custody, and asset division.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>5. Employment Law</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                            We guide both employers and employees through workplace disputes, unfair dismissals, and contractual issues.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>6. Intellectual Property (IP) Law</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">Our IP team protects your creative assets — trademarks, copyrights, and patents — from infringement and misuse.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uZRDsrq37G",
          "_anchor": "list05-x",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".item-wrapper img": {
              "width": "80px",
              "height": "80px",
              "object-fit": "cover",
              "border-radius": "50% !important"
            },
            ".item-mb": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "background": "@cardbg",
              "padding": "2.25rem",
              "height": "100%",
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem"
              }
            },
            ".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".card-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "features026",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features026\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Card</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImage\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Price\" name=\"showPrice\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\" selected>2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#cccccc\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 mb-0 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>OUR LAWYERS</b></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\tYou can add more elements to this list by clicking on the \"Add Copy\" button.\n\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>Mr. Adrian Lim</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\"><b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tManaging Partner\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Adrian has over 20 years of legal experience in corporate and commercial law.\n<br>He believes in strategic thinking, ethical advocacy, and building long-term client relationships.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-auto\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  <a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Buy now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop1.jpg\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>Ms. Rachel Tan</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\"><b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSenior Associate\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRachel specializes in family and employment law. She is known for her empathy and clear communication, guiding clients through complex legal processes with confidence.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-auto\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  <a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Buy now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop2.jpg\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>Mr. Daniel Wong</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\"><b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLitigation Lawyer\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Daniel is passionate about defending justice.\n<br>His courtroom experience includes civil, criminal, and arbitration cases.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-auto\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  <a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Buy now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop3.jpg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>Ms. Alicia Lee</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\"><b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSenior Associate\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Alicia advises clients on property transactions and contract drafting.\n<br>Her attention to detail ensures that every deal is secure and transparent.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-auto\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  <a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Buy now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uZRI12JnOm",
          "_anchor": "features026-10",
